Package: xfce4-sweaters
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, python3-cairo, python3-pil, python3-xlib, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Recommends: xfwm4
Description: Knitted borders for XFCE4 windows on X11
 Draws a click-through knitted border around every window managed by
 Xfwm4. Ships 47 built-in knitting charts, gives each window a stable
 random pattern and colour by default, supports persistent rules by
 WM_CLASS and title, custom PNG textures, a GTK settings window and a
 panel icon. Requires an X11 session with the XFCE compositor enabled.
